{"5062730":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Card Harts Reborn","steam_appid":5062730,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Fey Games Return<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For many millennia, there have been dark forces at work. Gods, Angels, Demons, and Fey have long fought battles for the Faith, Souls, and even Bodies of Mankind. The Fey, in particular, being of an egalitarian nature, have always loved settling disputes via games. One card game in particular has been their favorite since it was first born in Ancient Egypt. While Demons will take what they want by force, and Angels seek only your faith, the Fey and their ancient pantheon will instead give you a chance to play their game. To win anything, or to lose everything. To them, your soul only has value if they win it fairly, of your own accord.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, in this modern day and age, the Fey and their Games are waking again from their ancient slumber. The latest awakening in a never-ending cycle of dormancy, as the Gods and Spiritual Beings of the world turn their sights to us for their entertainment and power struggles yet again. For the first time since they were rebuked and sealed away in the Heian period of Japan, a thousand years ago.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Their Game<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you sit, you lock a Deck Core of fifteen, and up to three Addon slots — Theme Packs, Victory Packs, or Boss cards you have unlocked. When the match begins, both of you draft twenty cards from a shared Main Card Pool.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then the table. Ten Hearts each. You Invoke Combatants. You Hide or activate Sorceries. You Battle in Offensive Stance or Guarded Stance. Effects that activate in sequence will resolve in reverse order.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a player online, or challenge the AI. H-Bucks come from win streaks. The Card Shop takes them for Theme, Victory, and Boss packs. Bigger streaks become Prize cards. High scores keep the best of the best. Tournaments are coming.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to seal away the ancient forces for another thousand years? Or perhaps you would use the Fey Games to gain power and glory unlike anything you had imagined possible. May the Art of the Cards be with you, as the Ancient Magics are, once again, Reborn.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Fey Games Return<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For many millennia, there have been dark forces at work. Gods, Angels, Demons, and Fey have long fought battles for the Faith, Souls, and even Bodies of Mankind. The Fey, in particular, being of an egalitarian nature, have always loved settling disputes via games. One card game in particular has been their favorite since it was first born in Ancient Egypt. While Demons will take what they want by force, and Angels seek only your faith, the Fey and their ancient pantheon will instead give you a chance to play their game. To win anything, or to lose everything. To them, your soul only has value if they win it fairly, of your own accord.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, in this modern day and age, the Fey and their Games are waking again from their ancient slumber. The latest awakening in a never-ending cycle of dormancy, as the Gods and Spiritual Beings of the world turn their sights to us for their entertainment and power struggles yet again. For the first time since they were rebuked and sealed away in the Heian period of Japan, a thousand years ago.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Their Game<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you sit, you lock a Deck Core of fifteen, and up to three Addon slots — Theme Packs, Victory Packs, or Boss cards you have unlocked. When the match begins, both of you draft twenty cards from a shared Main Card Pool.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then the table. Ten Hearts each. You Invoke Combatants. You Hide or activate Sorceries. You Battle in Offensive Stance or Guarded Stance. Effects that activate in sequence will resolve in reverse order.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a player online, or challenge the AI. H-Bucks come from win streaks. The Card Shop takes them for Theme, Victory, and Boss packs. Bigger streaks become Prize cards. High scores keep the best of the best. Tournaments are coming.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to seal away the ancient forces for another thousand years? Or perhaps you would use the Fey Games to gain power and glory unlike anything you had imagined possible. May the Art of the Cards be with you, as the Ancient Magics are, once again, Reborn.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"A F2P 3D strategy card game. Invoke Combatants, cast Sorceries, and wager Hearts on an altar inside of an Ancient Egyptian tomb, in a game far older than this age.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Japanese<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062730\/84325eb5c6fc22103833884e274d66747da84d73\/header.jpg?t=1793686041","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062730\/4c9661fa99c659741d23f99dfedab38356e1430b\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793686041","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062730\/4c9661fa99c659741d23f99dfedab38356e1430b\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793686041","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 \/ AMD equivalent (2.0 GHz+)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11 compatible GPU (integrated graphics OK)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX compatible \/ any (optional — “Integrated sound” is fine)<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 \/ 11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 \/ AMD Ryzen 5<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Dedicated GPU with 2 GB VRAM (or “any modern discrete GPU”)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Card Hearts Reborn"],"publishers":["Card Hearts Reborn"],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":49,"description":"PvP"},{"id":36,"description":"Online PvP"},{"id":35,"description":"In-App Purchases"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"},{"id":"37","description":"Free To Play"},{"id":"70","description":"Early Access"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062730\/626a4bb7193d7eb9cb2ebb8c8dd36e68c85b29ef\/ss_626a4bb7193d7eb9cb2ebb8c8dd36e68c85b29ef.600x338.jpg?t=1793686041","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062730\/626a4bb7193d7eb9cb2ebb8c8dd36e68c85b29ef\/ss_626a4bb7193d7eb9cb2ebb8c8dd36e68c85b29ef.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793686041"},{"i